## Why This Is Asked
Tests translating CAPA into actionable steps for a concrete, repeatable risk. It targets beginner CAPA skills without vague theory.

## Key Concepts
- CAPA data model design
- Lifecycle/state machine
- Evidence capture and traceability
- Lightweight REST API for CAPAs
